# pcehr-compiled-wsdl-java

Maven artifact **`au.gov.nehta:pcehr-compiled-wsdl`** — MHR **PCEHR B2B** WSDL resources and pre-generated JAX-WS/JAXB types. **Not** facade clients (**mhr-b2b-client-java**). **Not** Healthcare Identifiers (**hi-wsdl-java** / **hi-b2b-client-java**).

## Documentation

Follow **`documentation-standards.mdc`**. Integrator docs use **version numbers** — not Git branch names.

| Version | Java | XML stack | `Service` stubs |
| ------- | ---- | --------- | ----------------- |
| **1.6.3** | 8 | **javax** / EE4J **`jaxws-rt` 2.3.x** in consumers | **12** (MHR B2B) |

**Git branch mapping (maintainers only — never in integrator docs):**

| Version | Git branch |
| ------- | ---------- |
| **1.6.3** | `java-8-javax` or `java-8-javax-full-wsdl` |
| Java **11** / Jakarta types line | `java-11-jakarta-full-wsdl` (separate checkout; MHR facade clients on **mhr-b2b-client-java** **`java-11-jakarta`**) |

## This checkout

**`1.6.3-SNAPSHOT`**: Java **8**, **`javax`** committed types, **12** MHR B2B **`@WebServiceClient`** services. WSDL under **`src/main/resources/wsdl/`** and legacy tree **`src/main/java/wsdls/`** — **committed** (not separately licensed like HI WSDL). **`pcehr_override/`** xmldsig package. Sources **frozen** — no **`wsimport`** in this POM.

## Build

- JDK **8+**, from repo root: `mvn -B "-Dgpg.skip=true" clean verify` (quote `-D` on PowerShell).
- Default build uses **committed** `src/main/java` — no wsimport.
- After wsimport regeneration: **`python scripts/fix-javadoc.py`** then **`mvn verify`** (**`doclint=all`**, **`failOnWarnings=true`**).
- Consumers add Eclipse EE4J **`com.sun.xml.ws:jaxws-rt` 2.3.7** at runtime — **not** Metro **`webservices-*`**.

## vs mhr-b2b-client-java

| | **pcehr-compiled-wsdl-java** | **mhr-b2b-client-java** |
|---|---|---|
| Delivers | WSDL on classpath + generated types | Facade clients, TLS, signing |
| Artifact | `pcehr-compiled-wsdl` | `mhr-b2b-client` |
| Java **11** / Jakarta | Separate branch here; facades in **mhr-b2b-client-java** | In-repo **`wsimport`** on **`java-11-jakarta`** |

Align **`pcehr-compiled-wsdl`** and **`mhr-b2b-client`** at the **same version** on the Java **8** line (**`1.6.3`**). **`mvn install`** this types JAR before unpublished **`mhr-b2b-client`** **`verify`**.

